  "summary": "The code correctly implements all Cosmos DB CRUD operations requested by the prompt with clean TypeScript structure. However, it falls short on several Azure SDK best practices: no @azure/identity usage (uses master key instead), no RestError handling, no @azure/logger integration, and uses fetchAll() instead of for-await-of for query pagination. The prompt-specific functional requirements are all met.",
  "issues": [
